D533 2715             (    forth6809.asm):03629                     BEQ   ENDW
D535 A684             (    forth6809.asm):03630                     LDA   ,X
D537 A1E4             (    forth6809.asm):03631                     CMPA  ,S
D539 270B             (    forth6809.asm):03632                     BEQ   CONSUME
