DE3A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05431                     PSHU  D
DE3C BDDE9C           (    forth6809.asm):05432                     JSR   CCALL
DE3F 3706             (    forth6809.asm):05433         ECLOOP:     PULU  D
DE41 10830004         (    forth6809.asm):05434                     CMPD  #TAGCASE
